 "notes": "Both old kinds kept (Oven -> Built-in oven, Hob) with their old sources and ranges. Eight new kinds added per plan. Tier brands for ovens/hobs: Which? reliability survey covers AEG, Beko, Bosch, Hotpoint, Miele, Neff, Samsung, Siemens, Zanussi among others, but winners are behind a paywall, so no test-winner models were named; no further oven/hob SKUs added. Left out (no retrieved confirmation): AGA eR3, Gaggenau 200 series and 400-series ovens, Miele MasterCool, Westin and Falmec hoods, Wolf hobs/ovens, Lacanche founding year, Officine Gullo founding year, Bosch/Siemens brand entries. Freestanding fridges and dishwashers stay in B5. No craft traditions apply to this shelf."
